    {
      "id": "claim_d2e7d85cdd504ae5ba1daaff813744a0",
      "statement": "Instruments support two types: `card` (international credit card) and `np_card` (domestic bank card), defined by the InstrumentTypes utility class.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/InstrumentTypes.java",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:db455759abc08bcf9971650ada4a82e82fbf57dc4600c103e35ffd9077056e6c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2aa1b13fe06467b98792ffd4e29a1fe",
      "statement": "Instruments follow a state machine with states `created`, `authorization_required`, `approved`, `expired`, `locked`, and `deleted`, defined by the ResourceStates class.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/util/ResourceStates.java#L6-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:64a0001f219e6d0c79756063ba57a816a85636540efb9d3ecfad044433350803:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_45ec36d5170c4245a9566e4c20a91eb3",
      "statement": "Instrument creation (InstrumentService.insert) assembles a sensitive-data map, generates an HMAC integrity hash via OneSMService.encryptHMAC, encrypts the map with AES via OneSMService.encryptAES, masks the card number, and persists via the PKG_INSTRUMENT.instrument_insert stored procedure.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/service/InstrumentService.java#L128-L218",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5cf5c87681b43e6054b59e167bc8dd5e046fc8d8805aa8fcbb71c6ae59cf349e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f27207dc9bb845ab83383c8e58313293",
      "statement": "The InstrumentPostHandler validates the request body is non-empty, rejects unsupported instrument types against the configured `instrument.accept.types` list, rejects empty card numbers, and for `card` type enforces a scheme regex `(4|5|2|35|34|37)\\d+` plus expiry month in 1-12 and a positive year.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/server/handler/instrument/InstrumentPostHandler.java#L29-L63",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:175604159fc78a1da665876689ceb172752de1d56a909831b3596b9c6aa081ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_91aee3ed81724d16a1922682afc7675e",
      "statement": "The token reservation feature in InstrumentPostHandler automatically generates a token immediately at instrument creation when the `token.reserved` flag is true OR when the instrument state equals `approved`, returning the token alongside the instrument in the response.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/server/handler/instrument/InstrumentPostHandler.java#L73-L86",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2e6c820399dd5b8c200c2a9c6e7ff6baad12ba1144c10985c9ebeb457bfb08ab:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_029346a9da8c496f90e5b67850dc49ad",
      "statement": "The `token.reserved` flag and `instrument.accept.types` configuration are read from app.properties during application startup in Main.java and assigned to the static fields InstrumentPostHandler.tokenReserved and InstrumentPostHandler.instrumentAcceptTypes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/tsp/vault/Main.java#L63-L64",
