    {
      "id": "claim_ea52f0a25747403abf5f55de88c4783f",
      "statement": "Instrument retrieval (InstrumentService.get) calls PKG_INSTRUMENT.instrument_get and throws ResourceNotFoundException when no record is found; when the decrypt flag is true, the encrypted S_DATA and S_DATA_EXTRA blobs are decrypted via OneSMService.decrypt and parsed into instrumentData/instrumentDataExtra maps.",
