    {
      "id": "claim_b0c07d8cddd44c2fb9f708b61b5923f0",
      "statement": "The InstrumentGetHandler supports three retrieval modes: by instrument ID (returns decrypted instrument), by comma-separated token numbers (returns a list of matching instruments each with its token_number), and by token number with expiry/cvv/sequence/pay-time parameters (validates the token CVV and resolves the instrument).",
